WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We are hanging out
with Cate Blanchett!

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:03.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
Aw, we love you so much!
Come on.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:07.273
Her new movie, "Ocean's 8,"
is in theaters on June 8th.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.743 align:start size:94% position:6%
Cate and I are about to go
head-to-head

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:11.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
in a game of
egg Russian roulette.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:15.048 align:start size:94% position:6%
Higgins, would you like to
explain how this works?

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:17.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, James!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:20.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
In my hand,
I have one dozen eggs.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.023 line:92%
Eight of them are boiled!

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.324 line:92%
And four of them are still raw.

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:27.927
You and Cate will take turns
selecting one egg at a time

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:30.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
and smashing them upon the top
of your head.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:34.968
You won't know which eggs are
raw and which are hard-boiled.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:37.404 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Cackles ]

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:41.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
Once you chose an egg,
you must smash it!

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:42.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
No put-backs.
-Okay.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.245
-First one to smash two raw eggs
on the head loses.

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:48.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have to get on a plane
right after this.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.215 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No! Oh, perfect.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:49.949 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Well, then, good luck.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:52.952 size:84% position:42%
-Nothing like being pat
with egg on your head.

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:54.120 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Buena fortuna, Cate.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.890 line:92%
You choose the first egg.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.525 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay, anyone?

00:00:58.525 --> 00:00:59.259 line:92%
Anyone from the audience?

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:02.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
Should I chose this one?
[ Audience shouting ]

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.930 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
No? Or this one?

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:06.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
That one?
-Don't tap them.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right, good, that's --
-Good luck!

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What do I do, Jimmy?
What do I do?

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:14.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just smash it.
Just smash it and have faith.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:19.913 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:24.984 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:26.252 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-All right.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.854 line:92%
-It still hurt. It still hurt.

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:28.388 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It still hurts.

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:29.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right, you can put that --
-Okay.

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, here we go.
-I don't eat it?

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:35.161 line:92%
-No, you don't eat it, no.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.362 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Oh, my God, it smells.

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.097 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:39.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The white one?
Thank you, the white one.

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:40.467 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-The white one!

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:42.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I already can tell
it's hard-boiled.

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:45.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's great.
This game is so easy.

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:52.579 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:54.714 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Come on, choose one.

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:59.052 size:78% position:39%
-Be it on your head,
servicemen and women.

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:01.688 line:92%
-Here you go. This is it.

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:06.192
How's it feel? You feeling good?
You feeling confident?

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:07.127 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Ooh!

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:10.930 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:14.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
It's getting egg-citing!

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:16.636 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:18.771 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:23.042
-That gentlemen over there
seems extremely confident.

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.577 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hoo!

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:28.681 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.483 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you, guys!

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:33.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you to the gentlemen
in the glasses.

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:34.988 line:92%
-This happening. It's happening!

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
One of these -- there are four
raw ones in there.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:42.228
Oh, my God, please stop handling
the eggs like that. Please.

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:44.097 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:50.470 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:54.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Why would you aim it
at my head?

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:58.811 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:01.581
-Ooh, I got to start hitting
them in a different place.

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:03.483
-Really? Are you starting to --
-Yeah.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:05.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Are you starting
to break the skin?

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:08.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I'm gonna sue.
-Okay.

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:10.490 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, oh, oh!

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:13.026 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:16.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I love having you on.
Congrats on the new movie!

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:19.432 line:92%
It's gonna be a big success!

00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:22.335 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience oohs ]

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:40.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I guess the yolks on you!
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:41.721 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:46.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one?
[ Audience shouting ]

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:50.163 line:92%
I think you have betrayed me.

00:03:50.163 --> 00:03:52.465 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:52.465 --> 00:04:02.041 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:04.877 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hey.

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:08.314 line:92%
-Oh, my gosh, this is insane.

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:12.352
They're not even helping me
anymore -- there's no one.

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:13.319 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:16.189 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:18.958 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Loser!

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:21.761 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-No way, man! No way!

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:23.563 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:24.697 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Dinging ]

00:04:24.697 --> 00:04:32.005
The winner -- the champion,
Cate Blanchett, everyone.

